# ABOUTME: Sibling auxiliary-function file for react_cie_hepp.jet
# ABOUTME: chemRate2() overrides reaction index 2 with the He++ number density

# chemRate2 overrides the rate of reaction index 2 (He++ + E -> He+) with the
# He++ number density.  n_Hejj is a density shorthand: under the j/k charge
# convention it decodes to nden[<He++ index>, 0].  The tgas argument is unused;
# it only keeps the declaration a well-formed function.
@function chemRate2(tgas)
    return n_Hejj
